[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0010","text":"那首歌，是现在正火的那首对吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0020","text":"啊，市川小姐……\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0030","text":"辛苦了～！\n——啊，难道说雏菜打扰到你了～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0040","text":"没、没有……\n没关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0050","text":"你喜欢那首歌吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0060","text":"────倒也不是特别喜欢……\n只是我在打工的地方要写宣传文案……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0070","text":"啊～，你在打工来着是吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0080","text":"啊，好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0090","text":"之前一直只有流媒体版本，这次要出CD了\n想着得好好听一听——这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0100","text":"诶～～～\n原来是这样啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0110","text":"是的，就是这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0120","text":"那，那个……我先失陪了————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0130","text":"好～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0140","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022300_03_0150","text":"感觉那首歌，\n又想再听一遍了～"}]
